Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.15,0:00:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.14,0:00:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你确定是吸血鬼吗  -毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're sure it's vampires?  - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们的始祖在组建一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their Alpha's building an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不再惧怕我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't scare them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是已经死了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得是救了萨姆的东西复活了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're guessing whatever pulled Sam up pulled me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:23.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管它是什么  我们都成了它的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whatever this is, we're both a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:25.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们不知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你没事吧  是萨姆  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you all right? It's Sam, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有点儿不一样了  我觉得他不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just -- he's different. Something's not right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  迪恩  真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.02,0:00:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是你故意让他变成吸血鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost like you let him get turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想找人打入内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a man on the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.79,0:00:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好帮我们找到吸血鬼始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}help us find that Alpha vamp we've been looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我会让我亲哥哥这样冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'd do something like that, risk my own brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.61,0:00:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么  我都可以指望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what happens, I can always count on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.99,0:00:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Of course, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.46,0:00:54.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么东西  你不是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you? You're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.44,0:00:55.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了  听我解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼的我干嘛要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell should I believe anything you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.38,0:00:59.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确出了问题  很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something wrong with me, really wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.15,0:01:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.07,0:01:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  他看起来很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. He looks terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:31.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.89,0:01:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么...  放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's -- let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.70,0:01:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他有发烧吗  -你有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has he been feverish? - Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.85,0:01:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有没有过胡言乱语的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he speaking in tongues?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.13,0:01:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有过胡言乱语的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you speaking in tongues?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  你干嘛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在给我看病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you diagnosing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:47.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好希望他能看出个所以然来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hope he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真觉得这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think that this is --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.62,0:01:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你真觉得有个诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you think that there's a clinic out there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.09,0:01:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门治疗"地狱后遗症"是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}for people who just pop out of hell wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.83,0:01:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他问你答\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asks, you answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许废话  懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you shut your hole. You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.43,0:02:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你每天睡多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}At all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来之后就不睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since I got back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:09.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道就不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it never occurred to you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事儿有点奇怪么\N{\fnArial\fs30}that there might be something off about that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然有  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it did, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我只是没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I just never told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.61,0:02:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在有什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you feeling now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我鼻子断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like my nose is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是身体上的  我是问你的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's a physical sensation. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我觉得  -内心的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I think -- - Feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...  不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这会让你不太舒服  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This will be unpleasant. - What --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬着它忍耐下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite down on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有某个地方能让你感到宽心\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's someplace that you find soothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就在你脑海中\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想象你正身临其境\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啥发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是个好消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.35,0:03:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生理上  他非常健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Physically, he's perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我... 很抱歉  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm s-- I'm sorry. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍  当我是五岁小孩好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more time, like I'm 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思  你说他没有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, he's got no --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知为何  萨姆复活之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow, when Sam was resurrected,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.23,0:04:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就没有了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was without his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那它在哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.47,0:04:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它还在封印米迦勒和路西法的牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}still in the cage with Michael and Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那  他还是萨姆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is he even still Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.49,0:04:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你提出了一个很有趣的哲学问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you pose an interesting philosophical question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.35,0:04:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就把他的灵魂找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, just get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -你都可以把我救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Well, you pulled me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初救你牺牲了好几位天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took several angels to rescue you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且那时候看守也不是很严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you weren't nearly as well guarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆的灵魂在路西法的牢笼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's soul is in Lucifer's cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就有所不用了  是非常不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a difference, a big difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  肯定有办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, there's got to be a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们到底要不要给我松绑  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, are you gonna untie me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不会...  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm not gonna -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.17,0:04:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, how the hell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你走出这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}am I even supposed to let you out of this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我不是精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm not some psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want you to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.54,0:04:40.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想阻止那些吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to stop the vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.10,0:04:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会再发生这样的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't ever happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你开玩笑的是吧 -那你要怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}-You're kidding, right? -Well, what are you gonna do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.31,0:04:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我永远关在这里么\N{\fnArial\fs30}just keep me locked up in here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒觉得那样没什么不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.93,0:04:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧  我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine, look, I get it. 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了  迪恩  我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, Dean. I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我告诉你  我想恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm telling you I-I'm trying to get right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.87,0:05:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:04.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So just let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门儿都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想事情变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want it to come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能把我关起来  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna hold me, Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关这儿不行  关避难屋里不行  都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here, not in a panic room, not anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.81,0:05:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有灵魂  你又摆脱不掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stuck with the soulless guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就跟我合作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you might as well work with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们搞定这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:32.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会监视你的一举一动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be watching every move you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.77,0:05:33.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.52,0:05:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实应该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds about right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  帮他治疗下伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, clean him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们想搞清楚你的灵魂是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, if we're gonna figure out what happened to your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就得先知道谁把你拉出地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we need to find who yanked you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.24,0:05:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就一个一个来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we start a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果复活一个人不是易事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's so hard to spring someone out of the box,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.08,0:06:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那谁才拥有这种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}then who's got that kind of muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于复活  你一点记忆都没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no memory of your resurrection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在一片田野里醒来  我就知道这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up in a field. That's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.39,0:06:12.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无头绪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clues? None?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外公办烧烤聚会  竟然也不电邮邀请我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gramps throw a barbecue, leave us off the e-vite list?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -你好  小贱货\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Hello, Newman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.37,0:06:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.44,0:07:01.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别客气快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come right on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:04.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点事儿想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.43,0:07:09.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你复活那天  发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day you got back, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就说过了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我们家小翅膀帮手再说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, recap it for our wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比我想象的更消瘦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scrawnier than I pictured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是一副皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的真身和你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My true form is approximately
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱斯勒大厦一样大\N{\fnArial\fs30}the size of your Chrysler Building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.78,0:07:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啦  行啦  别炫耀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, quit bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:31.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死了  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you were dead, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.47,0:07:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就突然身在埃山街上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, pow, I was on Elton Ridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,具体过程和原因都不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know how. Don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位  我全部坦白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing to hide, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你介不介意小卡复查一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you mind if Cass here double-checks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.14,0:07:54.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没事  -搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使体腔大搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel cavity search.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  克里斯蒂安  你出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine, Christian. Just give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是  -你回避一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But -- - just give us a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那是搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的灵魂完整无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}His soul is intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然有...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I have a --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:27.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将我拉上来的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever dragged me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我的灵魂落下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}left a piece behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你事先知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  但是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有点不对劲  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it was something. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你是出色的猎魔人  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hell of a hunter, Sam, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实话实说  有时候你真吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the truth is, sometimes you scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这事儿怎么办  怎么处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the deal here? How do we fix this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:08:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么拿回他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get his soul back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不知道  但我们必须把它找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know yet, but we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然会助你们一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm here to help, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有何线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}What leads you working?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.92,0:09:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了从你这查之外  毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of dead ends and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.39,0:09:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去寻找线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, we'll just have to dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不管我们啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:17.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正身处天堂内战之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the middle of a civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好回去找找有什么能帮助萨姆的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better tear the attic up, find something to help Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.23,0:09:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  你们的事儿最重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Your problems always come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会和你们保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来想叫他留下喝杯啤酒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would've asked him to stick around for a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.35,0:09:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面那读书俱乐部咋回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's with the book club outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在组织一场猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting together a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次猎魔而已  怎么这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of guys for one hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到他了  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.61,0:09:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有吸血鬼始祖的线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a lead on the Alpha vamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.64,0:09:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么查到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you track him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自有妙招\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗  "自有妙招"\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all I get? "We're good"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the run?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黎明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.97,0:10:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不叫上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't call me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是很信任我  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't trust me very much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别是在这种重要的猎魔活动时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when it comes to big game like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.57,0:10:23.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好啊  我们要加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, then, we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别介意  但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.83,0:10:26.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是不相信我咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只是不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像了解萨姆那么了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not like I know Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你发号施令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call the plays.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.65,0:10:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我百分百遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}100%. I'm here to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啥时候这么听话过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.57,0:10:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼的始祖哎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big daddy bloodsucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想错过好戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't gonna miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.07,0:10:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这是你的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is your deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.44,0:10:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会听从你的指令  我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll follow your lead. I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:10:59.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:01.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是你现在没有灵魂  你也能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you weren't robo-Sam, you'd feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...You.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.55,0:11:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你不相信家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying you don't trust family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们接近他  打入内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we hang close, we blend in, 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看能发现什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we see what we can pick up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得萨穆埃尔和我的灵魂有关吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Samuel's connected to this whole soul thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.49,0:11:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得他是唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still think he's the only lead we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你迷路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:25.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想打个电话  需要一点私人空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had to make a phone call. Just needed some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔上锁的办公室  真够隐秘啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel's locked office is pretty private.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.40,0:12:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没锁上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打给谁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.01,0:12:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的妻子  告诉她我今晚过不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife. Let her know I'm not gonna make it over tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我一直努力对你友好点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've tried playing nice, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但是我受够了  -等等  你是想告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I think I'm done. - Wait, are you trying to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你表面不讨好  内心更混蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're a bigger knob than you've been letting on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.61,0:12:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在这里  安安分分地做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy who's been here, doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.64,0:12:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁  你以为我们需要你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you? You think we need you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.77,0:12:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里四处游荡  游手好闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walk around like you're playing pro tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你近来做的运动只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only action you seen lately
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你的淫娃女友上床而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}is between your slut girlfriend's legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定明天要和我们一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you want to come with us tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天有不测风云哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accidents happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 伙计  我罩你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, man. I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.19,0:13:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子就在山那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house is just over the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有十几个吸血鬼  还有始祖  \N{\fnArial\fs30}About a dozen vamps and the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.57,0:13:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只有一次机会解决这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got one shot at this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯蒂安  你负责侧面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christian, take flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人跟着我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you are with me and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Gwen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩扫尾  解决漏网之鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}hang back, sweep any stragglers we flush out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:13:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪敢啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我跟个过气货一起扫尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the rear with the reject?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.35,0:14:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.18,0:14:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点都不好  你就有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing's fine. You're not fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉说你是"过气货"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about the "Reject" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.71,0:14:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还听过更难听的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, I've been called worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点厌倦扫尾的工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, get sick of getting left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概因为我让他想起他的女儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think it's probably 'cause I remind him
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}of his daughter or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.92,0:14:49.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是说出了自己的心声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you just speak your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我就当你在夸我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that as a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.60,0:14:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那绝对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.93,0:15:36.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该留守在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.08,0:16:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  把他塞进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, get him in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,塞进去  开下山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in, drive this down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边一切顺利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.28,0:17:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,削了个逃兵的脑袋  没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, chopped up a runner. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.03,0:17:26.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.91,0:17:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点难度  但还是搞定了一个始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough, but one Alpha down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在哪里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.06,0:17:36.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想向它致以最后的敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to pay my last respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.21,0:17:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带些棉花糖  它已经在火上烧着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, bring marshmallows. Already on the pyre.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才还行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things go okay back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么奇怪的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你们押着始祖走出来了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you walk that Alpha out the door, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当我是疯了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, call me crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.66,0:18:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那绝对不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that seems weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.93,0:18:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:33.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该知道这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't supposed to know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-知道啥  -萨穆埃尔一直在这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Know what? - It's just something Samuel's been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住它们  带到某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catching things, taking them somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.17,0:18:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盘问信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}grilling them for info.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:41.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盘问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说折磨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞒着我是他的主意么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not telling me -- that was his idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:52.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.95,0:18:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:57.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你会把事情搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you'd mess it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:19:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会先开抢  后问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shoot first, ask questions later,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.15,0:19:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们要一些情报\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we needed to ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  我不在乎你没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I-I don't care if you've got soullessness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.02,0:19:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是得了要命的腮腺炎  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the freakin' mumps, man --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么那么看不清呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know better than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.39,0:19:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还想找回你的灵魂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even want your soul back?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两件事有关联吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does that have anything to do --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去过萨穆埃尔关它们的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been to the place where Samuel takes them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你参与过他们的盘问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, have you been in on these interrogations?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  但我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but I hear --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想要什么  目的又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does he want? And why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不觉得这一切很可疑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did it ever occur to you that this is really shady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我们的外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  相当赞的猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a guy who talks a great game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不能假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't assume that family means
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他和我们一样重视家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same thing to him as it does to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.49,0:19:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.81,0:19:48.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不明白  对吧  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't see it, do you?  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有本性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got no instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  你真的是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you are seriously messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多谢  -我没在开玩笑  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks.  - I'm not kidding, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:03.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人逼你跟我一起干活  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's forcing you to work with me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.89,0:20:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果我们要一起干\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来做主  我来指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drive the bus, I call the shots,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有事你都得向我汇报\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you tell me everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你觉得是否重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether you think it's important or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  因为你根本分辨不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}because -- trust me -- you can't tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去跟着萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, you know what, go -- go with Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.81,0:20:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看结果如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how that goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.26,0:20:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.71,0:20:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死孩子  记得敲门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, kid. Learn how to knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.47,0:20:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哥呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了  是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "Gone"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.71,0:20:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了快一小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean he left about an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.01,0:20:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我估计我俩再也无法统一立场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I just weren't seeing eye-to-eye anymore I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想入伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,入伙什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}In?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,参与盘问  所有的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the interrogations, on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.19,0:21:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个家  这就是我要的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}This family -- this is it for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.51,0:21:13.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你需要什么  我都会照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you need, I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.81,0:21:15.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我知道  -很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I know you will.  - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.03,0:21:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在解决你灵魂问题之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until we can figure out this soul business of yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要你保持现状\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to keep doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能  -不行  你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I can -- - No. You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.99,0:21:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.46,0:22:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我不会回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think I'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.28,0:22:16.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我大概有六成把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured 60/40.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.56,0:22:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔没上钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Samuel didn't take the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:23.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我采用了后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I went with plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有后备计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他手机的全球定位系统给启动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fired up the GPS on one of his cellphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该能跟踪他找到始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be able to track him right to the Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.86,0:22:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-老头子不会发现吗  -相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The old man won't notice?  - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.66,0:22:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他凹凸很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks velcro is big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.36,0:22:37.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里  找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. Got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.65,0:23:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死人血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man's blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用吸血鬼驱除剂来封锁这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the place down with vamp repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.32,0:24:04.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(无授权请勿入内)
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.51,0:25:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.07,0:25:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.46,0:25:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它在哪里  我们要怎么找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it? How do we find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.50,0:25:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗷  住手  好疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch. Stop. That hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.62,0:25:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.39,0:25:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与我们给你准备的大刑相比\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is club med compared to 
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we have planned for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.82,0:25:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有的是时间跟你耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got -- I got all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.43,0:25:45.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧了  我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.28,0:26:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩想整晚都这么藏着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you two going to hide all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.22,0:26:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.60,0:26:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我能帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.61,0:26:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几个问题问你  老滑头\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got some questions for you, skippy,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.47,0:26:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你哪也去不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you're going nowhere fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.45,0:26:50.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话别说这么死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.74,0:26:54.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我看锁得可是够死的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Locked down pretty tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.80,0:26:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加上流在你血管里的那些死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with all that dead blood rushing through your veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.08,0:26:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计你没那么多能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}not sure you got enough juice
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.25,0:27:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用吸血鬼的念力召唤帮手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to fire up that psychic bat-signal of yours, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.63,0:27:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实没那么多能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not near enough juice for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.09,0:27:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.71,0:27:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道咱俩这么熟  可以直呼其名了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize we were on a first-name basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们当然够熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.39,0:27:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟  你曾有那么一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, you were my child...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.87,0:27:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.38,0:27:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当吸血鬼的感觉爽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.66,0:27:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才是提问题的人  你个吸血魔头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking the questions here, Fright Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.61,0:27:37.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当人类初学用火时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your kind first huddled around the fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我便已在黑暗中生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the thing in the dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.64,0:27:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得现在你能伤到我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you think you can hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.31,0:27:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有的是时间  而你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have all night, boys. You do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.18,0:27:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 不管你们想知道什么 我都悉数奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'm happy to tell you whatever you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.54,0:28:01.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.07,0:28:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为很快  我便会让你们血流成河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because soon, I'll be ankle-deep in your blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.42,0:28:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸尽你们的骨髓\N{\fnArial\fs30}sucking the marrow from your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.51,0:28:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说真的是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're really it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.28,0:28:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼的祖先\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first of your species.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.89,0:28:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:18.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你是始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're the first...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.18,0:28:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又是谁创造了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who made you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.47,0:28:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万物由来  皆有其源\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have our mothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.38,0:28:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.50,0:28:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有近来的吸血鬼数量激增是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's with the big surge of vamps lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.11,0:28:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  就好像--\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's like --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.80,0:28:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将要开战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.13,0:28:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么萨穆埃尔把你带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Samuel bring you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.52,0:28:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你散发着阴冷的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.64,0:28:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.20,0:28:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an oddity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.96,0:28:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你感觉得到内心的空虚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you feel how empty you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:00.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有灵魂是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it like to have no soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.35,0:29:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-回答我  -你先说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Answer my question. - You first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.91,0:29:03.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了你才是被关着的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.70,0:29:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂这个东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing about souls --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.18,0:29:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  假如你有的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you've got one, of course --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.71,0:29:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终有归宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is they're predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.57,0:29:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死后  上天堂或下地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die, you go up or down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.52,0:29:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们的种族会去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do my kind go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.78,0:29:15.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟这儿老和尚念经了  怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough with the sermon, freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.19,0:29:16.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在回答你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to answer the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.51,0:29:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着上面  若我们"怪物"死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, when we "Freaks" die...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.79,0:29:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们魂归何处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是天堂  亦非地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not heaven, not hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.78,0:29:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.41,0:29:29.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢乐谷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legoland?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.58,0:29:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《神曲》都忘得差不多了吗  孩子们  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Little rusty on our Dante, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.17,0:29:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.10,0:29:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼狱  炼狱真的存在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory? Purgatory's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.87,0:29:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉  你个猪脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stupid cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.92,0:29:47.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.42,0:29:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里充满了像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is filled with the soul of every hungry thing like me 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.70,0:29:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾行走于世的饥饿的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that ever walked this earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.38,0:29:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这地方在哪儿  这才是真的谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is it? That is the mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.19,0:29:59.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是你们"善良的"外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is what your kindhearted granddaddy
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.22,0:30:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要从我这里逼出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is trying to beat out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.75,0:30:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔把你带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel brought you here...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.57,0:30:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是想找出炼狱的所在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find out where purgatory is?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.46,0:30:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直跟他说  这种事我怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep telling him -- how would I know such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.69,0:30:12.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他就是不肯放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he refuses to untie me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.58,0:30:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很清楚那地方在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know exactly where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔怎么会关心这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does Samuel care about any of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.85,0:30:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他才不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.31,0:30:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是奉命行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does as he is told.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.80,0:30:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果外公是傀儡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if the old man's kermit...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.48,0:30:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又是谁在操控他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose hand's up his ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.20,0:30:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥儿几个  晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.44,0:30:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我以前白痴见多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you know, I have seen some stupid in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:45.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可真没见过你这么白痴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you take the crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.98,0:30:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个破笼子就想把那大魔头关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting jaws in a fishbowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.35,0:30:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得能有好结果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think that's gonna end?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.63,0:30:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在玩儿什么火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what kind of game you're running --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.97,0:30:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我这是在玩儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, do you think I'm doing this for kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.24,0:30:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你是让这帮蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you got the rest of
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.28,0:30:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都觉得你是约翰·韦恩(西部片之王)\N{\fnArial\fs30}these feebs convinced that you're John Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:58.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以无论你在做什么  在隐瞒什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you're doing, whatever you're hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.33,0:31:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都会把你和你身边的人拖进地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna put you and everyone around you in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.54,0:31:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.36,0:31:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为咱俩有点特别的感觉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought we had something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.61,0:31:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you scared of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.45,0:31:29.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换做我  我会怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.70,0:31:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.87,0:31:54.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿好武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.38,0:32:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还剩多少死人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much dead man's blood we got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:27.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始祖还有多久会完全恢复\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long till the alpha's 100%?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.64,0:32:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一小时  或许还不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hour. Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.32,0:32:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得给他注入死人血  然后关回笼子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get him dosed up and back in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.32,0:32:33.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.41,0:32:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"不行"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "No"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.37,0:32:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  我不知道你有啥大计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't know what your big plan was,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.97,0:32:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但别想玩儿猫鼠游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But playing catch is not on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -不把那东西脑袋砍掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Dean -- We take the thing's head off,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.66,0:32:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会死在他手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it kills us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.89,0:32:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.68,0:32:48.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.16,0:32:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分头行动  逐间搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split up. Clear every room.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.07,0:32:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有机会  就扎他一针\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a shot, you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.14,0:32:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然杀不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna kill him, but
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.25,0:32:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但会让他的速度减慢许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}dude will move a lot slower without any kneecaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.32,0:32:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能逃过这一劫  你  我和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we make it through this, you, me, and Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要好好开次家庭会议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}are having one hell of a family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.17,0:34:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得他跑出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he ran out?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.19,0:34:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.31,0:34:23.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有灵魂的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy with no soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你准备了大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got big plans for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.55,0:34:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那讨厌的小灵魂真够碍事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's amazing how that pesky, little soul gets in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.66,0:34:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你就不用担心这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.12,0:34:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终究会成为一个完美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be the perfect...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.36,0:34:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禽兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.86,0:34:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克里斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christian?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.06,0:35:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太精彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.90,0:35:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.26,0:35:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.62,0:35:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的见面方式真够特别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an unexpected treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放了克里斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Christian back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.49,0:35:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说啥  -我侄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry? - My nephew!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.81,0:35:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚植入恶魔灵魂的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you just crammed a demon into!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.64,0:35:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非也  他很久前就被附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No. I had him possessed ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.70,0:35:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可关心我的作品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep an eye on my investments.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.70,0:35:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你俩认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You two know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.77,0:35:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没到基情的地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in the Biblical sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.36,0:35:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更像是种生意伙伴关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of a business relationship, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.05,0:35:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克劳力的走狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crowley's bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.46,0:35:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.51,0:35:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's precisely what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.44,0:35:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我抓的那个吸血鬼始祖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Alpha he's caught me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.29,0:35:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为他赢得了不少好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}is getting him a gold star.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.44,0:35:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啥时候开始在意吸血鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do you give a crap about vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.46,0:35:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.74,0:35:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天礼拜几  礼拜五吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's today -- Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.38,0:35:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想想 应该是从 还是关心你自己的事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since, let's see -- mind your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.90,0:35:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好全说出来  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may as well share with the class, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.43,0:35:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你在找炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're looking for purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.20,0:36:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们都听说了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you heard about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.71,0:36:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你到底有什么企图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You want to tell us why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.31,0:36:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是明摆着的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.68,0:36:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地盘  地盘  地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Location, location, location.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.46,0:36:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个开拓者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a developer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.90,0:36:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炼狱广阔无垠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purgatory is vast,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.28,0:36:13.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却利用不足  而且毗邻地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}underutilized, and hell-adjacent,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.11,0:36:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想为我所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.19,0:36:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-用来干什么  -你最好闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What for? - Best shut your gob.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.96,0:36:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当手下的无权向老板提问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Employees don't question management.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.56,0:36:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们可不是你手下  -你们当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We ain't your employees. - Of course you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.83,0:36:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且已经当了好一阵子了  多亏了你们外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have been for some time now, thanks to gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我留着他干嘛  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't keep captain chromedome around for his wit, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.15,0:36:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔知道很多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel knows things.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.35,0:36:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  他比你们谁都知道的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than any of you, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.28,0:36:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直就是本活的百科全书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking encyclopedia of the creepy and the crawly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.55,0:36:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我还知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.04,0:36:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩一直执着于对家庭的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are so hung up on family-loyalty nonsense,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.78,0:36:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说朝东  你俩绝不会朝西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said jump, you'd get froggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.56,0:36:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  游戏结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.90,0:36:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕好戏才刚上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, afraid not,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.11,0:36:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非你不想再见到萨姆的灵魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you want to see Sam's soul ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别唬人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.66,0:37:00.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们  萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them, Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.93,0:37:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他把我和萨姆带回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He pulled us both back, me and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.81,0:37:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:09.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能  小卡说那不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Cass says it takes big-time mojo
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.78,0:37:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一般的咒语能办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pull something like that off,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.00,0:37:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你不过是个在十字路口晃悠的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're nothing but a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.67,0:37:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是曾经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a punk-ass crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.08,0:37:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我可是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now? King of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.66,0:37:19.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我吧  我有那本领\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I've got the mojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.65,0:37:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我动动手指就能让萨姆的灵魂回归肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I snap my fingers, Sam gets his soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.04,0:37:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  你要还跟我对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you can be...You,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.04,0:37:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆就会被我推回黑洞里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I shove Sam right back in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.55,0:37:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢想象那洞里的情景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine what it's like in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.75,0:37:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我的想象力可是一流的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can imagine so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.66,0:37:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都清楚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.26,0:37:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是老板查理  你们是我的娇娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, Charlie... You, angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.81,0:37:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务很简单  给我捕猎去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job's simple enough -- bring me creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.17,0:37:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,食物链越顶端越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aim high on the food chain, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.27,0:37:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对大家都有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.63,0:37:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸会了  回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a pleasure. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.73,0:38:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.78,0:38:12.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the van.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.52,0:38:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然任凭一个恶魔发号施令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're letting a demon call the shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.68,0:38:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.70,0:38:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续猎魔  就这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hunt. Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.15,0:38:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  我会搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about him. I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.74,0:38:29.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你信不信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.63,0:38:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回车里去  格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the van, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.12,0:38:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟个恶魔合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working with a demon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.98,0:38:45.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我想的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not who I thought you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.68,0:38:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你根本不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know anything about me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.22,0:38:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么那么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's so important
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.85,0:38:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你能委曲求全给阎罗王当小弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're the king of hell's cabana boy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.60,0:38:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他到底给了你什么  \N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he offer you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.48,0:38:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人  金钱  还是头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girls? Money? Hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.08,0:38:58.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有我的苦衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.83,0:39:06.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要动手的话  就来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna make a move, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.06,0:39:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.82,0:39:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.24,0:39:11.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会对你们做任何事  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna do anything to you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.80,0:39:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}...You're my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:21.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以在我看来  你们有两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the way I see it, you got two choices --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.13,0:39:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么一枪嘣了你外公  要么闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a bullet in your grandfather or step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.72,0:39:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sold us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.91,0:39:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.87,0:39:32.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.76,0:39:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.75,0:39:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.00,0:39:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.13,0:39:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们绝不能给克劳力当帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't work for Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.26,0:40:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.29,0:40:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你没明白  恶魔永远心狠手辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you understand. Demons bone you every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.73,0:40:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我知道  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I get it. I do, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.69,0:40:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just running the math --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.95,0:40:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有别的路可走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we really have another choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.49,0:40:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一刀砍死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could stab him in his throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.04,0:40:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我的灵魂怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get my soul back how?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.73,0:40:15.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得  看来我们得跟他玩玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, seems like we got to play ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.02,0:40:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码眼下只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也没少做过傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done some stupid things in my time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.78,0:40:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但从没给恶魔打过工\N{\fnArial\fs30}but punching a demon's clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.61,0:40:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  只要等到我们想出其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just till we find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.26,0:40:27.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.67,0:40:30.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我们就去追杀克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we track Crowley down
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让那混蛋得到他应得的报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give that son of a bitch what's coming to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.00,0:40:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你支持我吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You with me, Dean?
